# The build context is the repository root: send only what the image copies.
# Each level is re-included and then narrowed again, because a file cannot be re-included under a directory that is still excluded.
*
!src
src/*
!src/pyproject.toml
!src/README.md
!src/LICENSE
!src/aletheore
src/aletheore/*
!src/aletheore/__init__.py
!src/aletheore/council
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
